# English + commits

- All **code, comments, API/OpenAPI text, commits, README, intake, and OpenSpec artifacts** MUST be English.
- Chat with the user may be Spanish; repository text must not.
- Commits MUST use Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `test:`, `refactor:`, …).
- Prefer named constants over magic numbers/strings; thin Swagger-documented controllers; services throw typed exceptions.
